    {
      "reviewer_name": "Anonymous",
      "rating": null,
      "title": "Hit or Miss Fast Charging",
      "review_text": "[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I'm not loving how short this cord is at all. This charger would get more use if the cord was a couple feet longer and I could hook it up and set it on my night stand. What I do like is that I can set my phone on the pad and it begins to charge immediately, no fumbling with cords. Set up is so simple a 2 yr old can do it, just plug in and charge your phone/ air pods. I do wish this charger had the ability to charge more than Samsung, IPhone and Air Pods. What would make this product even more incredible to make up for the short cord would be to make it magnetic. I have this plug above my bed and it would be nice if I could hang/ charge my phone from there. There is also an indicator light that lights up when it's charging. Also, the charger will sometimes wireless charge and sometimes fast wireless charge, it's not consistent and pretty much hit or miss. Overall, this product does charge my phone easily and very well but it does have some design kinks.",
